Error [jet.HoleHeaderEffect]: This `if` table header calls `grow`, which changes a value it is given
  --> Tests/UI/E0442_dispatch_hole_header_write.jet:10:8
    |
 10 |     if grow(items) % <> == 0 {
    |        ^^^^
 Why: A hole table runs its header once for each arm it tries, so `grow` would run again for every arm
 Fix: Name the value first: `value: grow(items)` on the line above, then read `value` in the header
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0442
